## The five verbs {#sec-verbs}

### `@filter` — pick rows

::: {#cell-filter .cell execution_count=1}
``` {.julia .cell-code}
@chain ponds begin
    @filter(richness > 8 && hydro == "permanent")
    nrow
end
```

